] \n (Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  The 1st person account of the storm from Beckie Tokarski\u2020\u2020 presented; scenes shown from Port Charlotte, Florida, of damaged buildings.  [TOKARSKI\u00a0- says her office is gone, her husband's job is gone; describes the limited damage to her home.]", "segment_duration": 440, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762337, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "DPqQCUsX6D", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-16", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762336, "segment_id": "npGD2SBrT9", "segment_broadcast_id": "DPqQCUsX6D", "segment_title": "Military / Troop Movements / Redeployment", "segment_description": "(Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  Report introduced.   (White House: Terry Moran)  President Bush's plan for a huge shift of the US military troops stationed overseas examined; details given of the redeployment proposal to withdraw troops from bases in Europe & Asia with half the installations in Europe being shut down.  [Before the Veterans of Foreign Wars, BUSH&nbsp- says the new plan will help us win the wars of the 21st century; notes the world has changed.]  [Brookings Inst. Michael O'HANLON&#134;- says people are not being brought back from Iraq & Afghanistan.]  [Former presidential candidate Gen. Wesley CLARK&nbsp- says this is not the time to unravel alliances.]", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63490.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762338, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_